<title>BRAZIL: Bahia cocoa arrivals 2.79 mln bags by March 9.</title>
<headline>Bahia cocoa arrivals 2.79 mln bags by March 9.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia 1996/97 cocoa arrivals totalled 2,793,242 million 60-kg bags by the week ending March 9 compared with 2,568,268 bags by March 10 last year, the Brazilian Trade Commission Comcauba said.</p>
<p>Arrivals in the two weeks from February 24 to March 9 were</p>
<p>as follows in 60-kg bags.</p>
<p> WEEK		  1996/97	     1995/96	    1994/95</p>
<p> Feb 24-March 2     10,537		25,214	     33,913</p>
<p> March 3-9	     8,880		15,977	     26,832</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
